message: "If you use this software or model, please cite it as below."
title: "Dichter & Denker: a from-scratch German classics persona chat model"
abstract: >-
  A 42M-parameter nanoGPT-style transformer trained from scratch on the German
  classics (Goethe, Schiller, Kant, Lessing, Kleist, Hölderlin, Novalis,
  Herder) and fine-tuned into a persona chat model, with a custom German BPE
  tokenizer. No pretrained weights.
